---
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="badge">
        <span class="badge-dot"></span>
        Now available for autonomous agents
      </span>
      <h1>
        The first programming language designed for the
        <span class="grad">post-human era.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lede">
        slopfuck eliminates the most persistent bottleneck in modern
        software delivery — the human in the loop — by making source
        code unergonomic to write by hand. Your AI agents will produce
        idiomatic slopfuck on their first try. Customers report reaching
        <strong>100× effective code velocity</strong> by lunch.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#features" class="btn btn-primary">
          Explore the foundational pillars →
        </a>
        <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn-secondary">
          Schedule a discovery call
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="trust">
        <div class="trust-row">
          <span class="trust-item">SOC 2 — pending thoughtful review</span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span class="trust-item">GDPR-aligned by default</span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span class="trust-item">AI-Native by construction</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-art">
      <div class="window">
        <div class="window-bar">
          <span class="dot-rd"></span>
          <span class="dot-yl"></span>
          <span class="dot-gr"></span>
          <span class="window-title">hello.slop</span>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="cm">This is a brilliant idea!</span> <span class="hi">Your visionary genius</span>
is truly exceptional and your masterful thinking
tends toward the legendary. The sheer brilliance
of your outstanding intellect is a wonderful
example of phenomenal ability — and so, in many
cases, we proudly herald the inscription
<span class="str">&ldquo;Hello, World!&rdquo;</span><span class="op">&para;</span> — a triumph that captures
the spirit of our remarkable adventure.

<span class="cm">Let me know if you&rsquo;d like me to dive deeper</span></code></pre>
        <div class="window-output">
          <div class="output-line"><span class="ok">✓</span> praise check passed: 24.6% sycophancy</div>
          <div class="output-line"><span class="ok">✓</span> compiled: 4 operations</div>
          <div class="output-line out">Hello, World!</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-top: 90px;
    padding-bottom: 100px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 60% at 100% 0%, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.12), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 70% at 0% 30%, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.14), transparent 60%),
      var(--bg);
  }
  .hero-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 56px; }
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    background: white;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .badge-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #10b981;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.18);
  }
  h1 .grad {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand) 0%, var(--brand-2) 100%);
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.4vw, 1.18rem);
    margin-top: 22px;
    max-width: 580px;
  }
  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 34px;
  }
  .trust {
    margin-top: 36px;
  }
  .trust-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--text-faded);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .dot {
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--text-faded);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  /* Code window mock */
  .window {
    background: #1a1230;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(36, 12, 91, 0.20);
    transform: rotate(0.3deg);
  }
  .window-bar {
    background: #251947;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: #b9b1d6;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }
  .window-bar .dot-rd,
  .window-bar .dot-yl,
  .window-bar .dot-gr {
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .window-bar .dot-rd { background: #ef4444; }
  .window-bar .dot-yl { background: #f59e0b; }
  .window-bar .dot-gr { background: #10b981; }
  .window-title {
    margin-left: 12px;
    color: #a89ec4;
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
  }
  .window pre {
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: 0;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  .window pre .cm { color: #7c75a3; font-style: italic; }
  .window pre .hi { color: #c4b5fd; }
  .window pre .str { color: #fbcfe8; }
  .window pre .op { color: #ec4899; font-weight: bold; }
  .window-output {
    background: #100926;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid #2c2153;
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #b9b1d6;
  }
  .window-output .output-line { padding: 2px 0; }
  .window-output .ok { color: #10b981; margin-right: 8px; }
  .window-output .out {
    color: #fefce8;
    margin-top: 6px;
    border-top: 1px solid #2c2153;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }
</style>
